                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h in the morning then tending southeast to southwesterly in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 34.</text>
